{"id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md","title":"Exact Sequence","display":"df-exact-sequence — Exact Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-exact-sequence","aliases":["58-df-exact-sequence","Exact Sequence","Exactness"],"display":"df-exact-sequence — Exact Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","[[58-df-module.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-exact-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-exact-sequence</span><span>Exact Sequence</span><span>Exactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exact-sequence — Exact Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55889258754cb9d9\" href=\"?note=55889258754cb9d9\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md\">../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module.md\">58-df-module.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n=A(n)\">\\(A_n=A(n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_n=f(n)\">\\(f_n=f(n)\\)</span> 为取值记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+,0,\\odot\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+,0,\\odot\\)</span> 为下式量化的结构数据。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> 为依赖文件中的九参数左模谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S(A,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\n\\exists R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\exists +,0,\\odot\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(A_n,R,+(n),0(n),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot(n))\n\\land0(n)\\in A_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A_n\\;\\bigl(+(n)(\\langle0(n),x\\rangle)=x=+(n)(\\langle x,0(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_n,A_n,A_{n-1})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A_n\\;f_n(+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+(n-1)(\\langle f_n(x),f_n(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in A_n\\;f_n(\\odot(n)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot(n-1)(\\langle r,f_n(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{f_{n+1}(x):x\\in A_{n+1}\\}=\\{x\\in A_n:f_n(x)=0(n-1)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S(A,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\n\\exists R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\exists +,0,\\odot\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(A_n,R,+(n),0(n),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot(n))\n\\land0(n)\\in A_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A_n\\;\\bigl(+(n)(\\langle0(n),x\\rangle)=x=+(n)(\\langle x,0(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_n,A_n,A_{n-1})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A_n\\;f_n(+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+(n-1)(\\langle f_n(x),f_n(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in A_n\\;f_n(\\odot(n)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot(n-1)(\\langle r,f_n(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{f_{n+1}(x):x\\in A_{n+1}\\}=\\{x\\in A_n:f_n(x)=0(n-1)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>精确性在同一组模结构上逐项表达；环运算、加法、零元及标量作用均受前两节中的量词约束。</li>\n<li>Short exact sequence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 \\to A \\xrightarrow{f} B \\xrightarrow{g} C \\to 0\">\\(0 \\to A \\xrightarrow{f} B \\xrightarrow{g} C \\to 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Snake lemma: connecting homomorphism in homology</li>\n<li>Five lemma: commuting diagram with exact rows implies isomorphism</li>\n<li>Split exact: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\cong A \\oplus C\">\\(B \\cong A \\oplus C\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md","status":"resolved","id":"55889258754cb9d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"A_n=A(n)","display":false},{"tex":"f_n=f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+,0,\\odot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S(A,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&A,f\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\n\\exists R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\exists +,0,\\odot\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Module}_S(A_n,R,+(n),0(n),+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot(n))\n\\land0(n)\\in A_n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in A_n\\;\\bigl(+(n)(\\langle0(n),x\\rangle)=x=+(n)(\\langle x,0(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_n,A_n,A_{n-1})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in A_n\\;f_n(+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+(n-1)(\\langle f_n(x),f_n(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in A_n\\;f_n(\\odot(n)(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot(n-1)(\\langle r,f_n(x)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\{f_{n+1}(x):x\\in A_{n+1}\\}=\\{x\\in A_n:f_n(x)=0(n-1)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0 \\to A \\xrightarrow{f} B \\xrightarrow{g} C \\to 0","display":false},{"tex":"B \\cong A \\oplus C","display":false}],"bytes":1857,"backlinks":[{"id":"7b1e5646c6075a74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal A},\\mathsf{Exact}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq V^2$ (explicit exact-sequence interfaces on the two categories, instantiated from [[58-df-exact-sequence]] in module categories)"},{"id":"3ff9bab1e15a730d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExactSeq}_S((A_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z},(d_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z})$ (exact-sequence predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-500","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-exact-sequence.md|58-df-exact-sequence]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["55889258754cb9d9","25e593b1b8714c23","ef3a5dd6825f0373"]}